<title>UK: TABLE-Siebe profits surge 28.1 pct in year.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Siebe profits surge 28.1 pct in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 5, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  54.1		 vs    45.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    9.80		vs     8.87</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   14.70		vs    13.31</p>
<p> Pretax			424.1		 vs   331.1</p>
<p> Turnover		  3,005.3		 vs 2,599.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 414.0 and 422.1 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Siebe Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
